WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.014 --> 00:00:05.096
Yikes!

2
00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:07.838
Who are you?

3
00:00:08.621 --> 00:00:10.925
I'm a scorpion.

4
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:16.206
Scorpions are arachnids.

5
00:00:16.926 --> 00:00:20.125
Those are creatures with eight legs.

6
00:00:22.902 --> 00:00:25.127
Where do you live?

7
00:00:25.754 --> 00:00:29.542
Scorpions live all over the world.

8
00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:34.292
Some live in forests or grasslands.

9
00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:37.715
Most live in the desert.

10
00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:41.390
What do you eat?

11
00:00:41.887 --> 00:00:46.328
We like insects, spiders, and snails.

12
00:00:47.636 --> 00:00:53.215
We have big front claws.

13
00:00:53.712 --> 00:00:56.282
Our claws help us hunt.

14
00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.648
Do you go underground?

15
00:01:01.712 --> 00:01:06.180
Yes. We burrow in soil or under rocks.

16
00:01:07.054 --> 00:01:09.826
We hide during the day.

17
00:01:10.371 --> 00:01:12.999
We come out after dark.

18
00:01:15.092 --> 00:01:17.574
I see your stinger!

19
00:01:18.322 --> 00:01:21.850
Our stingers are on our tails.

20
00:01:22.686 --> 00:01:24.772
They have venom.

21
00:01:25.322 --> 00:01:29.160
We use venom to poison our enemies.

22
00:01:31.029 --> 00:01:33.443
Who are your enemies?

23
00:01:34.015 --> 00:01:37.310
Scorpions have lots of enemies.

24
00:01:37.811 --> 00:01:42.110
Birds, toads, lizards, and snakes hunt us.

25
00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:46.314
Scorpions sometimes hunt each other!

26
00:01:48.214 --> 00:01:50.482
Do you lay eggs?

27
00:01:50.883 --> 00:01:54.855
No. We give birth to babies.

28
00:01:55.494 --> 00:01:59.138
At first the babies ride on our backs.

29
00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:03.584
A few weeks later, they leave their mothers.

30
00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.056
Here comes a hungry toad.

31
00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.524
See you later!

32
00:02:13.116 --> 00:02:15.647
Good-bye, Scorpion!

